# Female agent soldier: 64x64, 12-wide 32-row run-and-gun sheet. idle 0-4, walk 132-139, shoot 36-40, death 372-383; aim-angle and prone rows left out.
# GandalfHardcore pack (licensed to the author, not redistributable on
# its own). The world view plays IDLE, or WALK when moving, and flips
# to face the heading. Action rows beyond idle/walk bake for later use.

sheet fagent.ppm
cell 64 64

bank FAGENT
seq IDLE  loop ticks=4 : lin 0-4
seq WALK  loop ticks=2 : lin 132-139
seq SHOOT once ticks=2 : lin 36-40
seq DEATH once ticks=3 : lin 372-383
